      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1901-11-01_WidnesExaminer_art0008" n="art0008">
        <head>HAT VARNISHES.</head>
        <p>HAT VARNISHES.</p>
        <p>Before the great picture exhibitiOns in London open, comes a day which artists call varnishing day. The nimble fingers of our girl workers have also their varnishing day, when they varnish last season's hat to do another turn—Boots Hat Varnishes in Blank or suitable assorted colours are the best for this purpose. Price 40 per bottle.</p>
