        <head>REE B!LE BEANS.</head>
        <p>REE B!LE BEANS.</p>
        <p>A Genuine Offer. A great many people to whom Charles Forde's Bile Beans for Biliousness would do incalculable good, refrain from purchasing tern because in the past they have lost money on worthless prepara- tions. Once tried, Bile Beans are always used; and the proprietors have such faith in their pre- paration that they have decided to send a free sample to everyone applying for same during the next two weeks. The oaly condition imposed are, that you send this coupon together with your full name and address,and a penny stamp to pay return postage, Address your letter to Bile Bean FREE SAMPLE COUPON. 751. anuf acturing Co's Central Distributing Depot, Greek-street, :Leeds (Yorks.)and your ,application will be promptly responded to.</p>
