        <p>7 Week the Roman Catholics of Warrington ,orth strenuous efforts, by means of a three tilaPanese bazaar in Parr Hall, to raise a sub. . al sum on behalf of the building fund in con- -1 with; the new church of St. Mary, now in of erection at Latchford. The continuous , O the district in which St. Mary's MissiQn . .</p>
